.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt PKCS12_ADD_LOCALKEYID 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm PKCS12_add_localkeyid
.Nd Add the localKeyId attribute to a PKCS#12 safeBag
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/pkcs12.h
.Ft int
.Fo PKCS12_add_localkeyid
.Fa "PKCS12_SAFEBAG *bag"
.Fa "const char *name"
.Fa "int namelen"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn PKCS12_add_localkeyid
adds an octet string representation of the PKCS#9 localKeyId attribute
to a PKCS#12 safeBag.
.Pp
.Fa bag
is the
.Vt PKCS12_SAFEBAG
to add the attribute to.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 1 for success or 0 for failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr PKCS12_add_friendlyname_asc 3
